<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IDEC, Clorox &quot;featured stocks&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IDEC, Clorox &quot;featured stocks&quot;.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it cited IDEC Pharmaceuticals Corp and Clorox Co as featured stocks of the week.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- IDEC Pharmaceuticals lost 1/8 to 22-7/8 in morning trading. Clorox lost 1/8 to 120-7/8.</p>
</text>
